WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.760
Identify designated walkways, protected crossings and accessible
routes. Maintain clear sightlines at crossings.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:19.880
If a vehicle blocks the crossing, secure movement and arrange for
the obstruction to be removed before reopening it. Follow the
approved plan for barriers and traffic calming.

